OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer warns trespass runners risk
OL,4,Aserious injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA livestock farmer has warned runners
OL,7,Fare risking their lives by trespassing
OL,8,Fon farmland and has called on running
OL,9,Fapp operators to take action.
OL,11,FNicola Naylor said she had spotted
OL,12,Fpersistent offenders jogging through
OL,13,FBlackshaw Farm near Glossop,
OL,14,FDerbyshire, where cows are calving and
OL,15,Fare therefore very territorial.
OL,17,F"It's very, very difficult to expect
OL,18,Fcows to behave in a reasonable and
OL,19,Fpredictable way around people who are
OL,20,Fbehaving in an unpredictable way," said
OL,21,FNaylor.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,362,360,200,160,0,100
