OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer warns trespass runners risk
OL,4,Aserious injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrava, one of the most popular running
OL,7,Fapps in the UK, said it "cannot
OL,8,Findependently verify land ownership or
OL,9,Fproperty boundaries" and expected its
OL,10,Fusers to "obey all laws and rules".
